  <item>
    <title>08. 中东搞钱局，能诞生一批年轻的高净值新贵吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658c1192bf3589e894536378</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658c1192bf3589e894536378</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Dec 2023 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿联酋就像90年代的深圳，无数新机会吸引着全球人才聚集，中国的年轻人能在这里实现第一桶金的原始积累吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题对我来说也非常新鲜：中东财富机会。最近大家对中东的关注突然增多，像迪拜上半年就有600多家中资企业落户，这当中是不是有一些我们没有看到的财富快速积累的机会，而这些机会是年轻人的机会吗，是否能让中国新增一批年轻的高净值新贵呢？本期我邀请了一位中东市场的行家朋友 Alex，和我们聊聊中东的财富机会</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目聊完，打破了我对中东的传统印象，今天我们看深圳，或许就能理解为什么全球年轻人都涌向中东创富，深圳的今朝，或许就是中东的未来。吸金的中东到底靠的是什么？我们会在节目中为大家揭晓。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://okjk.co/yNmT8I" data-url="https://okjk.co/yNmT8I"><strong><span>主播：盛盛</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>前私募股权从业者，曾任职百亿估值独角兽和上市公司</span></p><span></span><p><span>进听友群请添加：czl13883516300（请备注“听友群”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>盛盛商务合作请添加：shengsheng091096</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><p><span>本期推荐播放倍速：1.5x</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期大纲</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾Alex经历介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 大学创业后项目被收购</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 回国后二次创业，年营收2-3亿</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 通过无人机赛道创业认识到中东市场的巨大潜力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> 创办看中东</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>出海为什么选中东</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 出海市场选择的3个特征</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> 不得不提印度政府独特的“捞钱方式”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> 政治关系好：中东对中国的友好程度超出想象</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 价值洼地：中国的红海竞争是中东的蓝海机会</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 中东主权基金：手握万亿美金的金主爸爸</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> 国际人才是市场主流：阿联酋本地人占比7.8%</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 地理位置优越：国际企业最爱的全球总部网红选址地</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 迪拜政府招商引资的智慧：就差求你来创业了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="977">16:17</a> 迪拜人均收入：公务员月入3-4万？？？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 税收优惠：把钱从公司拿进自己兜里，中国税40%，中东税9%</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1273">21:13</a> 人傻钱多，是我们对中东最大的偏见</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> 中东募资必听！中东主权基金像中国政府引导基金</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>年轻人的中东生活和致富机会</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">24:47</a> 你好，50°的中东夏天</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">25:37</a> 中东斋月：每天只工作3小时的摸鱼黄金月</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a> 中东油车有多便宜：开车送外卖</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> 中东房子为什么这么便宜？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> 违法成本巨高：原来创收都靠天价罚单啊</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> 给小企业的中东创业建议</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2102">35:02</a> 出海首站，迪拜or新加坡？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a> 在中东会因为战争嘎掉吗？安全是中东的全方位红线</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a> 中东，中国人的小香港和小深圳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> 为什么要巨资打造空中之城？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2446">40:46</a> 看好中东文旅创业：王子是中东特产</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> 年轻人的小资金中东创业方向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">44:22</a> 中文崛起！中国的下一个“新东方”在中东？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a> 中东创业，启动资金要多少</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 年轻人在中东的真实创富案例</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 游戏，与其在国内要死不活，不如去中东一展宏图</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">50:10</a> 华裔增多，给餐饮行业带来生意机会</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">51:48</a> 中东电商和外贸新机会：新奇特</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">52:28</a> 中东居然有巨大的茶市场</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3193">53:13</a> Temu和TT在中东的发展</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3255">54:15</a> 房地产有长期投资机会，中东未来或许也将进入房地产黄金周期</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3436">57:16</a> 劝退的创业赛道：色情行业</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>中东的金融和投资机会</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3491">58:11</a> 中东投资机会</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">58:52</a> 黄金是否有套利空间</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3574">59:34</a> 股票交易市场</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3657">1:00:57</a> 听友提问</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>中东创业投资的风险和弊端</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3747">1:02:27</a> Alex自己踩过的坑</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期是和播客</span><strong><span>《掘金中东》</span></strong><span>的一次串台，对中东财富机遇感兴趣的朋友欢迎关注~</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>友台推荐：《掘金中东》是全网第一中东商讯中文媒体【公众号：看中东 DeepMENA】旗下一档聚焦中东商业的深入对谈与分享栏目，提供最深度的中东商业洞察，发掘最真实的中东商业机遇</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>最后，祝你钱方高能，心想事成！</span></p>]]></description>
