  <item>
    <title>01. 8位数炒股、543%回报，他真金白银砸出来了哪些投资心得</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6539941548a62918d04d8bd1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6539941548a62918d04d8bd1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Oct 2023 22:17:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>A股越跌越乐观？不建议买黄金？选指数基金不如选主动基金？这些投资理财认知越是反常识，越值得拎出来仔细琢磨</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是钱方高能的第一期节目，开门大吉，我邀请了中国200多万户“高净值以上家庭”中的一员 Harry，一个曾在股市里最多放过8位数资产、实现过500%+收益率的人，来和我们聊聊那些年他真金白银砸出来的理财心得，除了股票和基金，我们的讨论也涉及银行理财、保险、黄金等理财产品，以及未来趋势不明朗的房产投资。聊的过程中，有很多反常识的思考很有意思，比如不建议购买黄金，比起私募更偏好公募，比起指数基金更偏好主动型基金等等，很多观点都非常值得拿出来和大家一起讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完本期，你将收获：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>股市：当下A股还值得投资吗，如何在A股赚到钱</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>基金：如何挑选优秀的基金和基金经理</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>不做韭菜：各类理财投资产品的合理预期收益率</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>黄金：对黄金投资的建议</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>房地产：对国内房产投资的建议</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>海外资产：房产、美债、汇率和合规风险</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://okjk.co/yNmT8I" data-url="https://okjk.co/yNmT8I"><strong><span>主播：盛盛</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加盛盛：shien20232023，进入钱方高能俱乐部群~ 回复不一定及时，请等待一下，时间有限，群内没什么运营，偶尔会有福利，照顾不周的地方多见谅</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期资料</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><h2><strong><span>Harry 19-21年的股票收益</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvHjxUO3NmGgiTtKBdxIa8vZK0ND.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>主动型基金的高费率</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgKEsPa3zjx_Wirm1FBz9vmlLdUD.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fka7512dBRqRBQaxTv3OlpKEH8So.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>国内主动型基金的收益率跑赢被动型基金</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMURcJ1AMn8eETA-4PLHCzIqtCU.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>美国主动型基金连续 9 年资金流出</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnAzle3afDgpjlhn2RihPkayioFg.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 什么是我们定义的高净值人群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> Harry自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> Harry宠粮品牌：纯刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">04:17</a> 股票持仓资金量和回报率情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 当前个人资金配置方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 余额宝当前利率1.8%，回不去的高利率时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 什么钱适合投入股市：未来3年都用不到的自有资金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 收益越高风险越高，反之不一定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 风险偏好低的人，长期收益率往往更高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a> 谨慎辨别包装成消费外衣的投资产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 回顾2018年的市场悲观情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 预期收益率的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 个人投资建议：别看账户</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> Harry的交易频率和换手率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 怎么看波段的长期回报率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 合理的股市预期回报率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 为什么反对股市加杠杆：收益风险不成正比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 私募基金高额管理费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> A股会继续往下跌吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 一个判断市场悲观/乐观程度的小工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a> 家庭资产还会投入资金到股市吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 中国的被动型基金不如主动型基金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a> 挑选主动型基金的3个判断标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> 判断基金经理是否专业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2537">42:17</a> 买个股不如买基金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2606">43:26</a> 不同投资方式的合理预期回报率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a> 相比私募，为什么选择买公募</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2892">48:12</a> 配置了哪些类型的公募基金：红利低波</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">50:26</a> 银行理财也要看底层资产，比如房地产暴雷导致的信托风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3122">52:02</a> 公司债的风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3197">53:17</a> 底层资产思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3398">56:38</a> 寿险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3512">58:32</a> 是否建议黄金投资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3613">1:00:13</a> 海外资产配置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3867">1:04:27</a> 国内的房地产投资战绩：完美错过（哈哈哈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，希望你钱方高能，心想事成！</span></p>]]></description>
